<main style="overflow:hidden;z-index:10;width:100%;min-height:100vh;position:relative;opacity:1"><div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 pb-16"><h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Terms and Conditions</h1><div class="space-y-10 text-[#ccc] text-[15px] leading-relaxed"><p class="text-[#777] text-sm">Last updated: February 24, 2026</p><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p>Welcome to Chilo. These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your access to and use of Chilo Exotics website located at Chilo Exotics, including all associated services, features, and content (collectively, the "Platform"). The Platform is operated by Chilo ("Chilo," "we," "us," or "our").</p><p class="mt-3">By creating an account, accessing, or using the Platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not access or use the Platform.</p><p class="mt-3">These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Chilo. Please read them carefully.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">2. Eligibility</h2><p><strong class="text-white">Age Requirement.</strong> You must be at least 21 years of age to create an account or use the Platform. By using the Platform, you represent and warrant that you are at least 21 years old. We reserve the right to request proof of age at any time and to suspend or terminate accounts where age eligibility cannot be verified.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Legal Compliance.</strong> You must reside in a jurisdiction where your use of the Platform and engagement with legal cannabis products is permitted under applicable law. You are solely responsible for determining whether your use of the Platform complies with the laws of your jurisdiction.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Account Eligibility.</strong> You may only maintain one account on the Platform. Creating multiple accounts to circumvent restrictions, manipulate rewards, or for any other purpose is prohibited and may result in termination of all associated accounts.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">3. About the Platform</h2><p>Chilo is a cannabis brand engagement platform. The Platform provides technology services that connect cannabis consumers with cannabis brands through product verification, reviews, rewards, and community features.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Chilo is not a cannabis retailer or distributor.</strong> We do not sell, distribute, deliver, or otherwise provide cannabis or cannabis products. All cannabis products associated with Clone tokens are manufactured, distributed, and sold by independent, licensed cannabis brands and dispensaries. Chilo has no control over the quality, safety, legality, or availability of any cannabis products.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">No interstate commerce.</strong> Clone token redemptions for cannabis products occur exclusively at licensed dispensary locations within the state where the products were produced and are legally sold. The Platform does not facilitate the interstate sale, transfer, or shipment of cannabis products.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">4. Account Registration and Security</h2><p>To access certain features of the Platform, you must create an account. When creating an account, you agree to:</p><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2 ml-2"><li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration</li><li>Maintain and promptly update your account information</li><li>Maintain the security and confidentiality of your login credentials</li><li>Accept responsibility for all activities that occur under your account</li><li>Notify us immediately of any unauthorized access to or use of your account</li></ul><p class="mt-3">You are responsible for all activity on your account, whether or not you authorized that activity. We are not liable for any loss or damage arising from unauthorized use of your account.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">5. Clone Tokens</h2><p>Clone tokens ("Clones") are digital promotional tokens that may be redeemed for cannabis products at participating licensed dispensaries, subject to availability and applicable law.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Nature of Clones.</strong> Clones are promotional items provided by participating cannabis brands. They are not securities, financial instruments, investments, or currency. Clones do not represent an ownership stake in Chilo or any cannabis brand. The value of a Clone is limited to the specific product redemption it entitles, if any.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Redemption.</strong> Clone redemption is subject to product availability at participating dispensaries, compliance with applicable state and local laws, valid age verification at the point of sale, and the specific terms established by the issuing brand. Chilo does not guarantee that any particular product will be available for redemption at any particular time or location.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Redemption Codes.</strong> Each Clone is associated with a unique redemption code. Codes are single-use and non-transferable once redeemed. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of any unredeemed codes in your possession. Chilo is not responsible for codes that are lost, stolen, or used by unauthorized parties prior to redemption.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">No Resale Value.</strong> Clones have no cash value and are not redeemable for cash. You may not sell, auction, or otherwise transfer Clones for monetary consideration. Chilo reserves the right to void Clones that are transferred in violation of these Terms.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Chilo Points Rewards</h2><p>Chilo Points are a virtual reward currency earned through platform engagement activities such as writing verified product reviews, participating in community features, and completing achievements.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">No Monetary Value.</strong> Chilo Points have no cash value and cannot be exchanged for cash, cryptocurrency, or any form of legal tender. Chilo Points are not currency, securities, stored value, or any form of financial instrument. Chilo Points may only be used within the Platform to obtain virtual profile customization items and other in-platform rewards as made available by Chilo.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Earning and Use.</strong> Chilo Points are earned at rates determined by Chilo, which may change at any time. The availability and pricing of items purchasable with Chilo Points may change at any time. Chilo Points balances are non-transferable between accounts.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Anti-Gaming.</strong> Chilo employs measures to prevent manipulation of the Chilo Points system. Attempts to artificially inflate Chilo Points balances through automated means, coordinated activity, exploitation of bugs, or other fraudulent methods may result in forfeiture of Chilo Points, account suspension, or termination.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Modification and Termination.</strong> We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue the Chilo Points program at any time, with or without notice. In the event the program is discontinued, any unused Chilo Points will be forfeited. You acknowledge that Chilo Points have no value outside the Platform and that you are not entitled to compensation for forfeited Chilo Points.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">7. User-Generated Content</h2><p>The Platform allows you to submit content including product reviews, text, photographs, videos, ratings, and other materials (collectively, "User Content"). By submitting User Content, you agree to the following:</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">License Grant</h3><p>By submitting User Content, you grant Chilo a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, sublicensable, and transferable license to use, reproduce, modify, adapt, publish, display, and distribute your User Content in connection with the Platform and Chilo's business operations, including for promotional and marketing purposes. This license survives termination of your account.</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Ownership</h3><p>You retain ownership of your User Content. However, you acknowledge that by posting User Content on the Platform, other users may view, share, and interact with it consistent with Platform functionality.</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Representations</h3><p>By submitting User Content, you represent and warrant that:</p><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-2 ml-2"><li>You own or have the necessary rights to submit the content</li><li>Your content does not infringe any third party's intellectual property or other rights</li><li>Your content is truthful and based on your genuine experience</li><li>Your content does not contain false, misleading, or deceptive statements</li><li>You have not received undisclosed compensation for your content from any third party</li></ul><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Review Policy</h3><p>Product reviews on Chilo are verified reviews. To review a product, you must have redeemed a Clone token for the specific batch being reviewed. Reviews represent the personal opinions and experiences of the reviewer.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Permanence.</strong> Reviews cannot be edited or deleted after submission. This policy exists to maintain data integrity and trust in the review system. Please review your content carefully before submitting.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Moderation.</strong> Chilo reserves the right to review, moderate, flag, or remove User Content that violates these Terms, is reported by other users, or is otherwise objectionable in our sole discretion. We are not obligated to monitor or review all User Content.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">8. Prohibited Content and Conduct</h2><p>You agree not to use the Platform to:</p><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2 ml-2"><li>Post content that is defamatory, threatening, harassing, or that promotes violence or hatred against any individual or group</li><li>Post content containing hate speech, slurs, or discriminatory language</li><li>Submit fake, fraudulent, or misleading reviews or content</li><li>Impersonate any person or entity, or falsely represent your affiliation with any person or entity</li><li>Post content that you do not have the right to share, including copyrighted material or trade secrets</li><li>Make health or medical claims about cannabis products, including claims that cannabis treats, cures, or prevents any disease or medical condition</li><li>Post content that depicts or promotes illegal activity beyond what is permitted under applicable state cannabis laws</li><li>Attempt to manipulate the Chilo Points system, reviews, votes, or any other Platform feature through automated tools, scripts, bots, or coordinated behavior</li><li>Attempt to access other users' accounts or private information</li><li>Interfere with or disrupt the Platform or servers or networks connected to the Platform</li><li>Use the Platform for any commercial purpose not expressly authorized by Chilo</li><li>Post advertising, spam, or unsolicited promotional content</li><li>Circumvent any age verification or geographic restriction measures</li><li>Post content depicting minors or content that is sexually explicit</li><li>Facilitate the sale, transfer, or distribution of cannabis outside of lawful channels</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">9. Messaging and Communications</h2><p>The Platform provides messaging features that allow you to communicate with other users, including direct messages and product-related channels.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Content Standards.</strong> All messages are subject to the same prohibited content standards described in Section 8. You may not use messaging features to harass, spam, or send unsolicited commercial messages to other users.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Encryption.</strong> Direct messages between users are end-to-end encrypted. Chilo cannot access the content of encrypted direct messages. Channel messages are transport-encrypted (TLS) but are not end-to-end encrypted and may be reviewed for moderation purposes.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Message Storage.</strong> Messages are stored on Chilo's infrastructure. Encryption keys for direct messages are stored on your device. If you lose access to your device or clear your browser data, you may permanently lose access to your encrypted message history. Chilo is not responsible for message data loss resulting from device changes or browser data clearing.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Blocking and Reporting.</strong> You may block or report other users for violations of these Terms. We reserve the right to restrict or terminate messaging access for users who violate messaging conduct standards.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">10. Brand Promotions and Contests</h2><p>Cannabis brands may offer promotions, contests, giveaways, or other promotional activities through the Platform. Each promotion may have additional terms, eligibility requirements, and rules established by the sponsoring brand.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Third-Party Responsibility.</strong> Brand promotions are sponsored by the respective brands, not by Chilo, unless expressly stated otherwise. The sponsoring brand is solely responsible for fulfillment of any prizes or promotional offers and compliance with applicable promotion and sweepstakes laws.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Eligibility.</strong> Promotions may require Clone redemption or other qualifying activity. Geographic restrictions may apply based on the brand's operating jurisdiction. You are responsible for determining whether you are eligible to participate in any promotion.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">11. Intellectual Property</h2><p><strong class="text-white">Chilo Property.</strong> The Platform, including its design, features, functionality, text, graphics, logos, icons, and software, is owned by or licensed to Chilo and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute, sell, or lease any part of the Platform without our prior written consent.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Brand Content.</strong> Cannabis brand names, logos, product images, and related content displayed on the Platform are the property of their respective owners and are used with permission. You may not use brand content without the brand owner's authorization.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">DMCA.</strong> If you believe that any content on the Platform infringes your copyright, please contact us with a notice that includes: identification of the copyrighted work, identification of the infringing material and its location on the Platform, your contact information, a statement of good faith belief that the use is unauthorized, and a statement under penalty of perjury that the information is accurate and that you are authorized to act on behalf of the copyright owner. Send DMCA notices to: legal@Chilo Exotics.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">12. Cannabis-Specific Disclaimers</h2><p><strong class="text-white">Federal Law.</strong> Cannabis remains a controlled substance under federal law in the United States, including under the Controlled Substances Act. While many states have enacted laws permitting the sale and use of cannabis for medical or adult use, these state laws do not change federal law. By using this Platform, you acknowledge the conflict between state and federal cannabis laws and assume all risk associated with your participation in state-legal cannabis activities.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Not Medical Advice.</strong> Nothing on the Platform, including user reviews, product descriptions, effect tags, or any other content, constitutes medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment recommendations. Cannabis product information and user-reported effects are provided for informational purposes only. Individual experiences with cannabis products may vary significantly. Consult a qualified healthcare provider before using cannabis for any purpose, especially if you have a medical condition or are taking medications.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">User Reviews Are Opinions.</strong> Product reviews and ratings reflect the personal opinions and subjective experiences of individual users. They are not endorsed or verified by Chilo beyond confirming that the reviewer redeemed a Clone for the reviewed batch. Effects, flavors, potency, and other experiential descriptions reported in reviews may not reflect your experience.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Local Law Compliance.</strong> Cannabis laws vary significantly by state, county, and municipality. You are solely responsible for understanding and complying with all laws that apply to you in your jurisdiction, including but not limited to laws regarding possession, consumption, transportation, and driving while impaired.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Product Responsibility.</strong> Chilo does not manufacture, produce, test, or quality-control any cannabis products. All product claims, lab results, potency information, and safety testing are the sole responsibility of the manufacturing brand and the licensed dispensary where products are obtained.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">13. Privacy and Data Collection</h2><p>Your privacy is important to us. This section summarizes our data practices. A comprehensive Privacy Policy is available separately and is incorporated into these Terms by reference.</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Information We Collect</h3><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-2 ml-2"><li><strong class="text-white">Account information:</strong> email address, username, display name, and password</li><li><strong class="text-white">Engagement data:</strong> Clone redemptions, reviews, Chilo Points transactions, messaging activity (metadata only for encrypted messages), and general Platform usage</li><li><strong class="text-white">User-generated content:</strong> reviews, ratings, uploaded photos and videos</li><li><strong class="text-white">Device and usage data:</strong> browser type, device information, IP address, and approximate location derived from IP address at the time of Clone redemption</li></ul><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">How We Use Your Information</h3><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-2 ml-2"><li>To provide, maintain, and improve the Platform</li><li>To process Clone redemptions and Chilo Points transactions</li><li>To verify eligibility for reviews and promotions</li><li>To detect fraud, abuse, and violations of these Terms</li><li>To communicate with you about your account and Platform updates</li><li>To provide aggregated, anonymized engagement analytics to participating brands</li><li>To send marketing communications if you have opted in</li></ul><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Data Sharing</h3><p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with participating cannabis brands in aggregated, anonymized form for analytics purposes. We may share information with service providers who assist in operating the Platform. We may disclose information when required by law or to protect our rights.</p><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-5 mb-2">Cannabis Data Sensitivity</h3><p>We recognize that cannabis-related data is particularly sensitive. We treat all data related to your cannabis engagement, including redemption history and product reviews, with heightened care. We will not share personally identifiable cannabis engagement data with any government entity except as required by valid legal process.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">14. Third-Party Services and Links</h2><p>The Platform may contain links to third-party websites or services, including cannabis brand websites, dispensary locators, and other resources. These third-party services are not under our control, and we are not responsible for their content, privacy practices, or availability.</p><p class="mt-3">Your interactions with third-party services, including any purchases made at dispensaries, are solely between you and the third party. We encourage you to review the terms and privacy policies of any third-party services you access.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">15. Disclaimers</h2><p class="uppercase text-sm">THE PLATFORM IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.</p><p class="mt-3 uppercase text-sm">CHILO EXOTICS DOES NOT WARRANT THAT THE PLATFORM WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR SECURE, THAT DEFECTS WILL BE CORRECTED, OR THAT THE PLATFORM OR ITS SERVERS ARE FREE OF VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS.</p><p class="mt-3 uppercase text-sm">CHILO EXOTICS MAKES NO WARRANTIES OR REPRESENTATIONS REGARDING THE QUALITY, SAFETY, POTENCY, LEGALITY, OR SUITABILITY OF ANY CANNABIS PRODUCTS ASSOCIATED WITH CLONE TOKENS OR REVIEWED ON THE PLATFORM.</p><p class="mt-3 uppercase text-sm">CHILO EXOTICS DOES NOT ENDORSE ANY USER CONTENT, PRODUCT REVIEWS, OR CANNABIS PRODUCTS DISPLAYED ON THE PLATFORM. USER REVIEWS REPRESENT THE OPINIONS OF INDIVIDUAL USERS AND NOT THE VIEWS OF CHILO EXOTICS.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">16. Limitation of Liability</h2><p class="uppercase text-sm">TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, CHILO EXOTICS AND ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AND AGENTS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, USE, GOODWILL, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES, RESULTING FROM:</p><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2 ml-2 uppercase text-sm"><li>YOUR ACCESS TO, USE OF, OR INABILITY TO ACCESS OR USE THE PLATFORM</li><li>ANY CONDUCT OR CONTENT OF ANY THIRD PARTY ON THE PLATFORM, INCLUDING CANNABIS BRANDS AND OTHER USERS</li><li>ANY USER CONTENT OR PRODUCT REVIEWS</li><li>THE QUALITY, SAFETY, OR EFFECTS OF ANY CANNABIS PRODUCTS OBTAINED THROUGH CLONE REDEMPTION</li><li>UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS TO OR ALTERATION OF YOUR DATA OR ACCOUNT</li><li>LOSS OF CANNABITS, CLONE TOKENS, OR OTHER VIRTUAL ITEMS</li><li>ANY CONSEQUENCES ARISING FROM THE CONFLICT BETWEEN STATE AND FEDERAL CANNABIS LAWS</li></ul><p class="mt-3 uppercase text-sm">IN NO EVENT SHALL CHILO EXOTICS'S TOTAL LIABILITY TO YOU FOR ALL CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO THESE TERMS OR YOUR USE OF THE PLATFORM EXCEED THE GREATER OF (A) ONE HUNDRED U.S. DOLLARS ($100.00) OR (B) THE AMOUNT YOU HAVE PAID TO CHILO EXOTICS IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS IMMEDIATELY PRECEDING THE EVENT GIVING RISE TO THE CLAIM.</p><p class="mt-3">Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion or limitation of certain damages. In those jurisdictions, the above limitations apply to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">17. Indemnification</h2><p>You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Chilo and its officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, or expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising out of or related to:</p><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-2 ml-2"><li>Your use of the Platform</li><li>Your User Content</li><li>Your violation of these Terms</li><li>Your violation of any applicable law, including cannabis laws in your jurisdiction</li><li>Your violation of any rights of a third party</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">18. Dispute Resolution</h2><p><strong class="text-white">Informal Resolution.</strong> Before filing any formal legal action, you agree to first attempt to resolve any dispute with Chilo informally by contacting us at legal@Chilo Exotics. We will attempt to resolve the dispute informally within 60 days. If the dispute is not resolved within that period, either party may proceed as outlined below.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Binding Arbitration.</strong> Any dispute, claim, or controversy arising out of or relating to these Terms or your use of the Platform that cannot be resolved informally shall be resolved by binding arbitration administered by the American Arbitration Association ("AAA") under its Consumer Arbitration Rules. The arbitration shall be conducted by a single arbitrator, and the arbitrator's decision shall be final and binding.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Class Action Waiver.</strong> You agree that any dispute resolution proceeding will be conducted only on an individual basis and not as a class, consolidated, or representative action. If this class action waiver is found to be unenforceable, the entire arbitration provision shall be void.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Exceptions.</strong> Either party may seek injunctive or other equitable relief in any court of competent jurisdiction to prevent the actual or threatened infringement of intellectual property rights. Claims within the jurisdiction of small claims court may also be brought in such court.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Governing Law.</strong> These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, without regard to its conflict of law principles.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">19. Termination</h2><p><strong class="text-white">By You.</strong> You may stop using the Platform and request deletion of your account at any time by contacting us at support@Chilo Exotics.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">By Chilo.</strong> We may suspend or terminate your account and access to the Platform at any time, with or without cause and with or without notice. Reasons for termination may include, but are not limited to, violation of these Terms, fraudulent activity, extended inactivity, or legal or regulatory requirements.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Effect of Termination.</strong> Upon termination, your right to access the Platform ceases immediately. Any Chilo Points balance, unredeemed Clones, shop items, and other virtual items associated with your account will be forfeited. Provisions of these Terms that by their nature should survive termination shall survive, including but not limited to Sections 7 (User-Generated Content license grant), 11 (Intellectual Property), 15 (Disclaimers), 16 (Limitation of Liability), 17 (Indemnification), and 18 (Dispute Resolution).</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">20. Modifications to Terms</h2><p>We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make material changes, we will notify you by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of these Terms and, where appropriate, by providing additional notice through the Platform or by email.</p><p class="mt-3">Your continued use of the Platform after any modification constitutes your acceptance of the updated Terms. If you do not agree with the modified Terms, you should discontinue your use of the Platform and contact us to close your account.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">21. General Provisions</h2><p><strong class="text-white">Entire Agreement.</strong> These Terms, together with the Privacy Policy and any promotion-specific rules, constitute the entire agreement between you and Chilo regarding your use of the Platform.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Severability.</strong> If any provision of these Terms is found to be invalid or unenforceable, that provision shall be enforced to the maximum extent permissible, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Waiver.</strong> Chilo's failure to enforce any right or provision of these Terms shall not constitute a waiver of that right or provision.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Assignment.</strong> You may not assign or transfer these Terms or your rights hereunder without our prior written consent. Chilo may assign these Terms without restriction.</p><p class="mt-3"><strong class="text-white">Force Majeure.</strong> Chilo shall not be liable for any failure or delay in performing its obligations where such failure or delay results from circumstances beyond its reasonable control, including but not limited to natural disasters, regulatory changes, or changes in federal or state cannabis law enforcement priorities.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">22. Contact Information</h2><p>If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us at:</p><div class="mt-3 bg-[#252525] rounded-lg p-4"><p>Chilo</p><p class="mt-1">Email: legal@Chilo Exotics</p><p class="mt-1">Website: Chilo Exotics</p></div></section></div></div></div></main>
